    "Start Cleaning does nothing: grant Accessibility permission, then try again. macOS may require restarting Lumi after the permission changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Cleaning does nothing: grant Accessibility permission, then try again. macOS may require restarting Lumi after the permission changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「开始清洁」无反应：授予无障碍权限后再试。macOS 可能需要在权限变更后重启 Lumi。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊「開始清潔」無反應：授予無障礙權限後再試。macOS 可能需要在權限變更後重新啟動 Lumi。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊「開始清潔」無反應：授予無障礙權限後再試。macOS 可能需要在權限變更後重新啟動 Lumi。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊「開始清潔」無反應：授予無障礙權限後再試。macOS 可能需要在權限變更後重新啟動 Lumi。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unlock shortcut does nothing: the session must be running, and all four keys must be held for a full second.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The unlock shortcut does nothing: the session must be running, and all four keys must be held for a full second."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁组合键无效：必须在清洁进行中，并且四个键都按满一秒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解鎖組合鍵無效：必須在清潔進行中，並且四個鍵都按滿一秒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解鎖組合鍵無效：必須在清潔進行中，並且四個鍵都按滿一秒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解鎖組合鍵無效：必須在清潔進行中，並且四個鍵都按滿一秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard still does not respond after a session: quit Lumi. The event tap belongs to the Lumi process and is removed when the process exits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyboard still does not respond after a session: quit Lumi. The event tap belongs to the Lumi process and is removed when the process exits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话结束后键盘仍无响应：退出 Lumi。事件 tap 属于 Lumi 进程，进程退出后即被移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段結束後鍵盤仍無回應：結束 Lumi。事件 tap 屬於 Lumi 程序，程序結束後即被移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段結束後鍵盤仍無回應：結束 Lumi。事件 tap 屬於 Lumi 程序，程序結束後即被移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段結束後鍵盤仍無回應：結束 Lumi。事件 tap 屬於 Lumi 程序，程序結束後即被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No overlay appears: check that the plugin is enabled and that accessibility permission is granted.": {
      "localizations": {
